WEBVTT

00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:01.292
and a broader role
that served her manager's needs, too.

00:08:02.333 --> 00:08:04.309
In doing so, Grace busted a third myth

00:08:04.333 --> 00:08:06.184
about getting results.

00:08:06.208 --> 00:08:09.309
Asking doesn't have to be a selfish act.

00:08:09.333 --> 00:08:10.726
Research shows that, sadly,

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:13.851
women are often at a disadvantage
in negotiations.

00:08:13.875 --> 00:08:16.143
In many cultures,
they're expected to be caring

00:08:16.167 --> 00:08:18.518
and communal and modest.

00:08:18.542 --> 00:08:21.393
When women negotiate,
they often face a backlash,

00:08:21.417 --> 00:08:25.226
because their assertiveness violates
these unfair gender stereotypes.

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:29.976
GS: Women should be quiet
and they shouldn't speak up,

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.976
and, you know, you should be
a dutiful daughter, not complain,